WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.905
The first crew to leave for the Moon.

00:02.590 --> 00:09.174
A Saturn V lifted off from pad 39A with Frank Borman, James Lovell and William Anders on board.

00:09.648 --> 00:14.513
Apollo 8 was the first crewed spacecraft to leave Earth's gravity and reach the Moon.

00:15.076 --> 00:17.355
The rocket here is NASA's model of it.
